      "writtenOn": "2022-10-20T01:40:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well... To be more clear, I meant we should maybe move this method to the common fuzz.go to be shared between java and cc and rust, instead of calling the cc/fuzz.go from java and rust.\n\nBut I guess since it\u0027s already done this way in rust, this is kind of a \"nit\".",
