      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-20T19:14:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: we could wrap it in another struct with the relevant information we want to add to the error message. \n\nHowever, I think the current implementation is ok since you are not mutating `android.Module` in the calling function",
